{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16548","headline":"过马侍中亭 · 陈翊","name":"过马侍中亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草色照双扉，轩车到客稀。\n苔衣香屐迹，花绶少尘飞。\n薄望怜池净，开畦爱雨肥。\n相过忘日昃，坐待白云归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈翊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}